00:55:40.230 --> 00:55:41.830
Pascale Gaudet: Yeah, they should all be.

00:55:41.830 --> 00:55:44.090
Jack Van Horn: Fantastic.

00:55:44.090 --> 00:55:48.050
One question I had is, you
